description	"Jedi Forcemaster

Light side masters who forego the use of a Lightsaber in favor of martial arts and Force proficiency.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Martial Arts (Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 75% more knockback
-- 60% more special damage
-- 40% shorter
-- 166% thicker

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Mind Trick (1)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (2)
- Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
-- Extra Regen: 1/5s to 40
- BP-Free Jumps
- Aerial Resource Regen
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block/Focus (3)

^3Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"